[193.189968, "o", "max diff triton: 0.0007811784744262695\r\nallclose 1e-4: False\r\nmax diff cublas fp16: 0.001321554183959961\r\nmax diff tf32: 0.0007790923118591309\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 20\r\nref mean ms: 2.009604787826538 min: 2.0040318965911865\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 20\r\ntriton_fp16 mean ms: 1.0115520060062408 min: 1.0071680545806885\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 20\r\ncublas_fp16 mean ms: 1.0392704069614411 min: 1.0314559936523438\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 20\r\ntf32 mean ms: 1.6380879938602448 min: 1.5899200439453125\r\n"]
