[1141.343057, "o", "[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 2, trials 10\r\nsplit kernel: 0.18373759984970092 ms\r\n--- fp16-input split GEMM ---\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 2, trials 10\r\nBM=128 BN=128 BK=64 w=8 s=3: 2.564 ms err=2.18e-03\r\nBM=128 BN=256 BK=64 w=8 s=3: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM=256 BN=128 BK=64 w=8 s=3: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM=128 BN=256 BK=64 w=8 s=4: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM=256 BN=128 BK=64 w=8 s=4: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM=128 BN=128 BK=64 w=8 s=4: FAIL OutOfResources\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 2, trials 10\r\nBM=128 BN=256 BK=32 w=8 s=4: 15.614 ms err=2.18e-03\r\nBM=64 BN=256 BK=64 w=4 s=4: FAIL OutOfResources\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 2, trials 10\r\nBM=128 BN=64 BK=64 w=4 s=4: 3.109 ms err=2.18e-03\r\n"]
